ation\/Persistence","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"Persistence","role":"collection","abstract":[{"text":"Keep each record on disk until it is delivered, so the records a tracker tracked survive the app ending.","type":"text"}]},"doc://Persistence/documentation/Persistence/DropReport/versionMismatch(event:storedVersion:currentVersion:recordCount:)":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Recovery read "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"recordCount"},{"type":"text","text":" intact records of the event named "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"event"},{"type":"text","text":" stored at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"storedVersion"},{"type":"text","text":", while the store’s type of that name is at "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"currentVersion"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Event.schemaVersion"},{"type":"text","text":"), and dropped them without decoding them: the version changed for a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change their bytes can’t be read through. Reported once per segment, or per database, for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each event and stored version, by the event’s name and then the stored version."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/persistence\/dropreport\/versionmismatch(event:storedversion:currentversion:recordcount:)","type":"topic","title":"DropReport.versionMismatch(event:storedVersion:currentVersion:recordCount:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/DropReport\/versionMismatch(event:storedVersion:currentVersion:recordCount:)","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"versionMismatch","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"event","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"storedVersion","kind":"externalParam"},{"tex